flowchart TD
    A["User completes a query"]
    A --> B{"Feature flags on?\n· not KAIROS · not remote\n· auto-memory on"}
    B -->|"no: return 0 cost"| Z["∅"]
    B -->|yes| C{"24h since last run?\n1 stat() call"}
    C -->|"no: return"| Z
    C -->|yes| D{"Scan throttle clear?\n10min in-memory"}
    D -->|"no: return"| Z
    D -->|yes| E{"5+ sessions touched?\nreaddir + stat"}
    E -->|"no: return"| Z
    E -->|yes| F{"Lock available?\nstat + read"}
    F -->|"no: return"| Z
    F -->|yes| G

    G["🔒 Acquire CAS Lock\nwrite PID → re-read → verify"]
    G --> H["⑂ Fork Agent\nisolated context · shared prompt cache"]

    H --> P1["Phase 1 · Orient\nls memory dir · read MEMORY.md · skim topics"]
    P1 --> P2["Phase 2 · Gather\nscan daily logs · grep transcripts · check drift"]
    P2 --> P3["Phase 3 · Consolidate\nwrite / merge memory files · fix dates"]
    P3 --> P4["Phase 4 · Prune\nMEMORY.md under 200 lines · remove stale"]

    P4 --> S["✓ Success — Improved N memories"]
    P4 --> FL["✗ Failure — rollback lock · retry in ~10m"]
    P4 --> K["⊘ Kill — abort agent · rollback lock"]

